2 TITL Karen Ann Kennedy Callahan  (1927 - 2014)
1 _OID 58a89a0a-35af-44d6-9331-372607a42d3d
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #36322d; font-family: 'source sans pro', helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #fafafa;"&gt;Karen Ann Callahan, age 87. She passed away after a brief illness o
2 CONC n Dec. 24, 2014 in St. Charles. Beloved wife of Bernard Callahan. Loving mother of Jim, Mary, Rick, Terri, Kevin, Bob, Dave, Robin, Nick and the late Carol Callahan. Loving grandmother of 18 and great-grandmother of 14. Dear sister of Trish Pickar
2 CONC d and Mike Kennedy. Bernie and Karen provided foster care for more than 50 children. She also worked as a Foster Care Advocate for the Illinois Department of Children and Family Services. Interment private.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></
2 CONC metadataxml>
